{"name": "Ladder Knight", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A LADDER FOR EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, solve puzzles, and fight your way through a world full of trouble. Put your ladder to work in situations it definitely wasn\u2019t built for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/8afef4e6cf0098617212ec704fe02645.poster.avif?t=1794958262\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/8afef4e6cf0098617212ec704fe02645.webm?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/8afef4e6cf0098617212ec704fe02645.mp4?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEEP CLIMBING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a strange world where every new place brings different dangers and surprises. There\u2019s always more to discover, more to figure out, and more reasons to keep your ladder close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/02e8a9c90971ed8539b36afec2848704.poster.avif?t=1794958262\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/02e8a9c90971ed8539b36afec2848704.webm?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/02e8a9c90971ed8539b36afec2848704.mp4?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEET THE LOCALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross paths with a whole cast of strange characters and creatures. Some will be happy to see you. Others will make you wish you\u2019d taken a different route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/7261bb5ef577c6c7a768417cfd437812.poster.avif?t=1794958262\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/7261bb5ef577c6c7a768417cfd437812.webm?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/7261bb5ef577c6c7a768417cfd437812.mp4?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A WORLD FULL OF SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden routes, secret places, and treasures tucked into every corner of the world. Bring your curiosity and put your ladder to work. There\u2019s a lot more here than the main path will show you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/a99b07ae4ea29d28984e8beced9f55eb.poster.avif?t=1794958262\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/a99b07ae4ea29d28984e8beced9f55eb.webm?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/a99b07ae4ea29d28984e8beced9f55eb.mp4?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> SMALL HERO. BIG TROUBLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The further you go, the bigger your problems get. Take on epic quests, face mighty bosses, and prove that even a small hero can do great things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/d4c35c5664c8d7c47d0fd6f0b34f0dcd.poster.avif?t=1794958262\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/d4c35c5664c8d7c47d0fd6f0b34f0dcd.webm?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/extras/d4c35c5664c8d7c47d0fd6f0b34f0dcd.mp4?t=1794958262\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A small hero, a trusty ladder, and a world full of trouble. Explore strange lands, solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and face mighty bosses in this pixel-art platformer. Put your ladder to work in ways it was never built for.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5279340/26b233bc60bf65371b32227f6a4bef9d90f17104/header.jpg?t=1794958262", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Platformer", "Pixel Graphics", "Action", "2D Platformer", "Exploration"], "developers": "Outlane", "publishers": "Outlane", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5279340", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "18 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0yU9Pxgq6YQ", "first_seen": 1794956400.0, "review_rank": 36}